[gd_scene load_steps=13 format=3]

; THE CHOSEN SET -- D2 tree, D3 cottage, D1 block, D3 Chuck, one house style.
;
; Forms as picked; palette, bake recipe and lighting unified. Shading angle
; still varies by what a thing IS: the cottage is cut (10 degrees, faceted),
; the block is moulded (18), foliage sits between (30).
;
; The blocks spell out letters with DESCENDERS on purpose -- g, y, p, j -- so
; the lettering fix can be checked rather than taken on trust. On the shipping
; block every one of those hung 0.062 units below its plaque.
;
; Camera and controls are the shipping ones. Nothing here is wired into the
; game; scenes/main.tscn is untouched.

